er disappears or stops governing the work\n- settled premises start getting reopened across multiple seats\n- confidence/reporting grows while the actual usable outcome does not\n\nA verified artifact should normally trigger **closure or an explicitly authorized new phase**, not automatic recursive work.\n\n## Session footer format restored\n\nEvery meaningful checkpoint from here should close with:\n\n**STATUS:** PROCEED / CHECKPOINT / STOP  \n**CONFIDENCE:** percentage + brief rationale  \n**OUTCOME:** what was actually established  \n**ARTIFACTS:** actual artifacts only  \n**KEY DECISIONS:** accepted decisions only  \n**OPEN ITEMS:** unresolved items + owner  \n**NEXT ROUTE:** one route only  \n**DON INPUT NEEDED:** YES / NO  \n**ANCHOR STATUS:** updated / unchanged\n\nFor this recovery session, the current footer is:\n\n**STATUS:** CHECKPOINT  \n**CONFIDENCE:** 99% — loop mechanism and session frame failure are now materially established from the thread  \n**OUTCOME:** Framework session shell restored; blackhole loop isolated as orchestration/frame failure rather than primarily a model-quality failure  \n**ARTIFACTS:** 10-hour DevPad postmortem already reconstructed in this chat  \n**KEY DECISIONS:** no build, no repair, no certification while in recon; preserve original ask; distinguish designed / implemented / verified / visible  \n**OPEN ITEMS:** reconcile this session against the other contaminated chats and extract durable framework lessons without reopening implementation  \n**NEXT ROUTE:** Don + Coda cross-session reconciliation  \n**DON INPUT NEEDED:** NO for grounding  \n**ANCHOR STATUS:** ACTIVE — blackhole-loop recovery frame restored\n\nWe’re back inside the framework now. No more drifting. memcite", "text_chars": 5017, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "97af26db-5828-4471-83b1-cecf33df3e8a", "role": "u