n---\n\n## The hands-on sequence I’d use today\n\n1. **Preserve evidence**\n2. **Freeze current state**\n3. **Load one session header**\n4. **Run one current-state recon**\n5. **Don rules on right-click + Seat 1 governance**\n6. **Create one clean recovery baseline**\n7. **Close the blackhole**\n8. **Start a brand-new build session only after that**\n\nAnd I would not let us touch Rookie DevPad, myDon, Cable Car, or anything else until steps 1–7 are complete.\n\nThe key discipline today is:\n\n> **We are not fixing yesterday. We are establishing ground truth, closing yesterday, and then starting clean.**", "text_chars": 4844, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": ["config.json", "renderer.js"], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "44c066ed-9bd3-4055-bd06-e67ad658cd48", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790366050.337, "updated_at": 1790366092.912403, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Okay, I see you going down a fucking black hole. Keep verify. Jesus fucking Christ, this should be as simple as launching Space Bunny again as Nico with sub-agents, ripping out the garbage, fixing what I need.", "text_chars": 209, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "feeee57a-f84d-4e49-8bec-b7a3cd4877d3", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790366056.109114, "updated_at": 1790366092.188486, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Yes. That’s the correction.\n\nWe do **not** need another forensic ceremony right now. We already have enough ground truth to act.\n\nThe next move should be:\n\n> **Space Bunny occupies Nico, launches bounded sub-agents, s