MOKE\nAfter integrated fix:\n- load board\n- launch representative seats\n- verify tile 3\n- verify tile 6\n- verify one or two unaffected seats\n- confirm server is running final code\n\nSub-agents may inspect and test.\n\nNico owns integration.\n\nDo NOT create a recursive Nico↔Luce loop.\n\n==================================================\nBUILD DISCIPLINE\n==================================================\n\nONE coherent pass.\n\nSequence:\n\n1. establish no active concurrent writer\n2. inspect current launch refactor\n3. reconcile ctx/runtime-root cleanly\n4. preserve identity-home semantics\n5. verify Space Bunny bindings for 3 and 6\n6. resolve 9-vs-10 truth\n7. syntax/static checks\n8. stop stale server\n9. start final server\n10. load actual DevPad\n11. launch/test actual seats\n12. return final state\n\nDO NOT stop after static validation.\n\nTHE BOARD MUST ACTUALLY LOAD.\n\n==================================================\nLIVE ACCEPTANCE\n==================================================\n\nPASS requires:\n\n- localhost:4727 responds\n- actual DevPad loads\n- correct board count established\n- board renders coherently\n- Tile 1 Coda works\n- Tile 3 Vittorio launches on Space Bunny/OpenCode\n- Tile 6 Nico launches on Space Bunny/OpenCode\n- at least two unaffected terminal seats launch\n- VoiceBridge tile remains intact\n- identities/roles unchanged\n- identity homes unchanged\n- no Kimi dependency for 3 or 6\n- no RUNTIME_ROOT_UNRESOLVED\n- no stale server serving pre-refactor code\n- keyboard terminal interaction works\n- no critical console/runtime error blocks operation\n\n==================================================\nFILES\n==================================================\n\nYou MAY modify only the existing DevPad launch/config files required to complete the interrupted refactor:\n\n- config.json\n- seats.js\n- adapter.js\n- adapters/opencode.js\n- server.js\n- public/renderer.js ONLY if necessary to restore core board usability\n\nDo NOT modify unrelated systems.\n\nDo NOT touch:\n- Rookie DevPad\n- myDon\n- Cable Car\n- Pigeon\n- ECQ\n- MLB\n- Framework canon\n- Drive\n- unrelated project trees\n\n==================================================\nNO NEW HANDOFF LOOP\n==================================================\n\nDo not automatically route to Luce.\n\nDo not create a new verification slice.\n\nDo not ask another seat to redesign this.\n\nThis pass ends with one of two states:\n\nA.\nMAIN DEVPAD RECOVERED AND RUNNING\n\nor\n\nB.\nBLOCKED — ONE CONCRETE EXTERNAL BLOCKER\n\nNothing in between.\n\n==================================================\nRETURN FORMAT\n==================================================\n\n1. STATUS\n   COMPLETE / BLOCKED\n\n2. CONCURRENT WRITER\n   ACTIVE / CLEAR\n\n3. 9 VS 10 TILE FINDING\n   exact answer\n\n4. LAUNCH-CHAIN ROOT CAUSE\n   exact broken seam\n\n5. FIX APPLIED\n   exact change\n\n6. SPACE BUNNY MIGRATION\n   Tile 3:\n   Tile 6:\n\n7. IDENTITY HOME\n   confirm preserved\n\n8. KIMI DEPENDENCY\n   confirm removed for 3 and 6\n\n9. SERVER\n   old pid:\n   new pid:\n   final code loaded:\n\n10. LIVE BOARD\n   URL:\n   tile count:\n   board rendered:\n   Tile 1:\n   Tile 3:\n   Tile 6:\n   unaffected seat A:\n   unaffected seat B:\n   VoiceBridge:\n\n11. CLIPBOARD\n   Ctrl+Shift+C:\n   Ctrl+Shift+V:\n   Shift+Insert:\n   Ctrl+C:\n   Right-click:\n   working OR deferred/non-blocking\n\n12. FILES CHANGED\n   exact files\n\n13. LOOP DEBRIS REMOVED\n   exact items only\n\n14. KNOWN NON-BLOCKING DEBT\n   only if real\n\n15. FINAL VERDICT\n\nSUCCESS PHRASE:\n\nMAIN DEVPAD RECOVERED — VITTORIO + NICO ON SPACE BUNNY — KIMI DEPENDENCY REMOVED — LIVE BOARD VERIFIED\n\nFAILURE PHRASE:\n\nBLOCKED — <single concrete blocker>\n\n==================================================\nSESSION FOOTER\n==================================================\n\nSTATUS:\nCONFIDENCE:\nOUTCOME:\nFILES CHANGED:\nVISIBLE RESULT:\nTILE COUNT:\nTILE 3:\nTILE 6:\nKIMI STATE:\nIDENTITY HOM